530
00:32:43,700 --> 00:32:48,180
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Beyond the budget figures, these investments reflect the very essence of DSWD's work,

531
00:32:48,560 --> 00:32:52,280
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: investing in human capital development, strengthening community-driven development,

532
00:32:52,280 --> 00:32:57,000
