534
00:33:00,180 --> 00:33:04,760
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: As social risk and vulnerabilities evolve, the DSWD implements innovative flagship programs

535
00:33:04,780 --> 00:33:10,880
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: and new approaches to address emerging social concerns and response to changing needs of Filipino families.

536
00:33:11,620 --> 00:33:15,080
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Walang Gutom addresses food insecurity, Tarabasa supports children's learning,

537
00:33:15,220 --> 00:33:18,120
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: while providing cash-for-work opportunities for the youth,

538
00:33:18,360 --> 00:33:20,860
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: and Pag-Abot reaches people in street situations,

539
00:33:21,320 --> 00:33:23,900
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: providing immediate food assistance through the Walang Gutom Kitchen,

540
00:33:23,900 --> 00:33:26,900
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: and connecting them to appropriate social protection services.

541
00:33:27,580 --> 00:33:35,200
