544
00:33:47,340 --> 00:33:52,360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: We are also developing targeted responses to prevalent and social welfare concerns.

545
00:33:52,360 --> 00:33:57,780
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: These include initiatives such as Project Aruga, Protect Teen, and Project Safe for Osaic Victims.

546
00:33:58,260 --> 00:34:07,580
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: These initiatives address the specific needs of children, adolescents, and families, strengthening our capacity to protect those at risk and deliver appropriate timely support.

547
00:34:08,080 --> 00:34:17,180
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: While we continue to innovate and respond to new challenges, we remain fully grounded in our core mandate, delivering regular programs and services that millions of Filipinos depend on.

548
00:34:17,520 --> 00:34:20,960
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: At the heart of these efforts is our commitment to invest in people.

549
00:34:21,640 --> 00:34:22,300
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Helping children.

550
00:34:22,360 --> 00:34:26,600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Helping children grow, families become more self-reliant, and communities move forward.

551
00:34:27,160 --> 00:34:29,040
