555
00:34:52,360 --> 00:34:56,360
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: To pay the conditional cash grants due to the 3.9 million beneficiaries.

556
00:34:57,200 --> 00:35:07,400
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: For 2026, our 112.9 billion allotment includes 98.3 billion for grants, with obligation and disbursement progressing according to scheduled payments.

557
00:35:07,400 --> 00:35:21,800
