00:37:27,940 --> 00:37:30,980
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: for adaptive and shock-responsive social protection.

589
00:37:31,660 --> 00:37:33,420
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Under the President's Uplift Initiative,

590
00:37:33,640 --> 00:37:35,960
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: we provided 5,000 cash assistance

591
