01:01:47,360 --> 01:01:54,540
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: it was the Chairperson, Risa Hontiveros, and also with the support of Senator Imee Marcos,

1209
01:01:54,800 --> 01:01:59,620
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: NAPC was given an additional budget of 140 million.

1210
01:02:00,260 --> 01:02:06,820
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: But, of course, not enough to roll out the full implementation of the Magna Carta of the Poor

1211
01:02:06,820 --> 01:02:08,600
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: because we are targeting two sectors.

1212
01:02:09,160 --> 01:02:15,480
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: NAPC is the only institution in government that talks about the two main sectors,

1213
01:02:15,620 --> 01:02:21,700
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: the government sector with 27 partner member agencies to include the DSWD, the DILG,

1214
01:02:21,700 --> 01:02:24,700
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: and all other agencies with PAPs on poverty reduction.

1215
01:02:24,800 --> 01:02:27,160
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Under Republic Act 11291.

1216
01:02:27,740 --> 01:02:31,340
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Also, 50% of that are the 14 basic sectors.

1217
01:02:31,920 --> 01:02:38,760
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Meaning to say that to ensure the full participation and representation at all levels of governments

1218
01:02:38,760 --> 01:02:41,300
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: pursuant to Republic Act 8425,

1219
01:02:41,840 --> 01:02:45,660
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: these two legislations plus the Community-Based Monitoring System,

1220
01:02:45,780 --> 01:02:52,820
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: ito po ang tatlong legal frameworks na kailangan talaga ni NAPC ng karagdagang pondo po.

1221
01:02:52,820 --> 01:02:54,400
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Otherwise, hindi natin maaabot.

1222
01:02:54,800 --> 01:02:57,160
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Yung sinabi ng batas, Republic Act 11291,

1223
01:02:57,500 --> 01:03:00,520
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: that says that there shall be an NPRP,

1224
01:03:00,820 --> 01:03:02,460
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: the National Poverty Reduction Action Plan.

1225
01:03:02,480 --> 01:03:04,920
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Diba di na kayo dalawang mag-usap, magkatabi na rin lang kayo?

1226
01:03:05,080 --> 01:03:06,900
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Para [unclear] na lang.

1227
01:03:06,900 --> 01:03:09,060
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Partner member agency po din sila ng NAPC, ma'am.

1228
01:03:10,000 --> 01:03:10,680
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Yes, ma'am.

1229
01:03:12,240 --> 01:03:15,880
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: PCUP is one of the 27 partner member agencies of NAPC.

1230
01:03:16,100 --> 01:03:17,900
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Anong opinion ni Secretary Rich?

1231
01:03:18,060 --> 01:03:21,120
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Madam Chair, we were all tasked to submit an optimization plan.

1232
01:03:21,120 --> 01:03:23,740
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: At nung pinangasiwaan ko sila, sa opinion ko rin,

1233
01:03:23,740 --> 01:03:24,860
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: dapat magkasama na sila.

1234
01:03:24,940 --> 01:03:28,320
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: The only deviation naman kasi, both of them are, they make policy.

1235
01:03:28,900 --> 01:03:33,440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Meron lang distinct na role si PCUP because they do the mediation pagka may mga demolition.

1236
01:03:33,520 --> 01:03:33,840
Senator Imee R. Marcos: That's right.

1237
01:03:34,780 --> 01:03:38,440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: But bukod doon, they pretty much act and feel the same.

1238
01:03:38,540 --> 01:03:41,540
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yeah, yung mga demolition and eviction yung sa inyo.

1239
01:03:41,780 --> 01:03:44,640
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yung accreditation ng mga urban poor groups, sino?

1240
01:03:44,820 --> 01:03:46,220
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Kayo o sa NAPC?

1241
01:03:46,600 --> 01:03:49,860
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Urban poor, dapat talaga magkaisan nila kasi watak-watak.

1242
01:03:50,100 --> 01:03:53,720
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Pero maliban pa sa dating kasamahan namin, si Senator Pacquiao,

1243
01:03:53,880 --> 01:03:56,360
Senator Imee R. Marcos: may isa pang sikat eh, akala ko na nandito, wala pala.

1244
01:03:56,700 --> 01:04:00,600
Senator Imee R. Marcos: Yung namamayagpag sa social media, yung Sofia Canlas, wala po.

1245
01:04:23,740 --> 01:04:28,100
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Okay, medyo nagigets ko na yung comment.

1246
01:04:28,580 --> 01:04:33,880
Senator Risa Hontiveros: But bago natin hingin kay Yusek Katong i-present nga yung budget ng NAPC,

1247
01:04:33,880 --> 01:04:41,140
Senator Risa Hontiveros: baka Chair Michelle Ann, meron din po kayong comment doon sa tanong ni Senator Aimee

1248
01:04:41,140 --> 01:04:44,040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: at yung dagdag na context na pinag-provide ni Secrex,

1249
01:04:44,420 --> 01:04:47,040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: kung bakit magkakahiwalay pa yung dalawang ahensya nyo

1250
01:04:47,040 --> 01:04:51,880
Senator Risa Hontiveros: at bakit hindi kaya pagsamahin, lalo na dalawang hindi malalaking budget,

1251
01:04:51,880 --> 01:04:55,200
Senator Risa Hontiveros: kung pagsamahin baka mas magkaroon ng impact.

1252
01:04:55,340 --> 01:04:57,580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: I think that's a question behind the question as well.

1253
01:04:57,660 --> 01:04:59,300
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: Okay, good afternoon Madam Chair.

1254
01:04:59,760 --> 01:05:04,380
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: So ang PCUP po ay naitatag nung sa visa ng EO82

1255
01:05:04,380 --> 01:05:09,580
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: para maging direct link between the poor and the programs and policies of the government

1256
01:05:09,580 --> 01:05:14,760
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: na napalakas ng EO69 para magsagawa ng social preparation.

1257
01:05:15,080 --> 01:05:18,920
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: Actually, PCUP lang po ang merong social preparation sa mandato.

1258
01:05:20,020 --> 01:05:21,140
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: Social preparation.

1259
01:05:21,880 --> 01:05:26,260
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: Asset reform, human development, livelihood programs

1260
01:05:26,260 --> 01:05:30,280
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: at yung nga pong nabanggit yung Secretary Rex na unique mandate ng PCUP

1261
01:05:30,280 --> 01:05:33,720
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: ay yung pag-conduct ng pre-demolition conferences

1262
01:05:33,720 --> 01:05:38,200
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: para sa mga mahihirap na humaharap sa demolition at eviction.

1263
01:05:38,740 --> 01:05:44,200
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: Ang PCUP po kasi ay nakafocus talaga sa urban poor sector.

1264
01:05:45,080 --> 01:05:50,540
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: So it's more of the social safeguards na ginagawa ng PCUP.

1265
01:05:50,540 --> 01:05:57,580
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: So ang understanding ko po sa NAPC, convener po ang NAPC nung 14 sectors.

1266
01:05:59,460 --> 01:06:03,720
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: So alam ko po, convener sila.

1267
01:06:04,440 --> 01:06:11,400
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: So meron silang sector ng urban poor, yung NAPC na tinatawag, one of the sectors.

1268
01:06:12,020 --> 01:06:19,740
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: But yung members nila, pero hindi sila yung as immersed as what we do.

1269
01:06:20,540 --> 01:06:24,240
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: Na talagang we organize urban poor organizations.

1270
01:06:24,820 --> 01:06:27,540
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: We conduct capacity building sa kanila.

1271
01:06:27,800 --> 01:06:29,220
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: We organize them.

1272
01:06:29,980 --> 01:06:33,720
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: And then kami talaga yung humaharap sa mga local housing board, LIAC.

1273
01:06:35,460 --> 01:06:40,780
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: Humaharap sa demolition at nagbibigay ng clearance.

1274
01:06:41,300 --> 01:06:44,660
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: Kung talagang naka-anchor po kasi kami sa UDHA.

1275
01:06:45,660 --> 01:06:48,280
PCUP Chairperson Michelle Anne B. Gonzales: Sa social safeguards ng UDHA.

1276
01:06:48,280 --> 01:06:56,720
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So siguro sapat na introduction na muna yan sa ngayon dun sa ipipresent yung mga budget.

1277
01:06:57,200 --> 01:07:03,480
Senator Risa Hontiveros: And I'm sure factors yung sinabi ninyo pareho dun sa optimization plan na sinabmit na ni Secretary.

1278
01:07:03,760 --> 01:07:11,300
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So I think naman ang Senado is laan na suportahan kung ano yung best na nakikita naming policy direction

1279
01:07:11,300 --> 01:07:18,260
Senator Risa Hontiveros: nung pag-streamline ninyo ng instruments of the executive para ipatupad yung poverty alleviation,

1280
01:07:18,280 --> 01:07:22,880
Senator Risa Hontiveros: at saka yung rights and welfare promotion ng mga informal settlers.

1281
01:07:23,260 --> 01:07:29,780
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So Yuseg Katong, baka gusto nyo ituloy muna yung brief presentation ng NAPC budget para sa aming subcommittee.

1282
01:07:31,460 --> 01:07:33,340
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Yes ma'am. Thank you very much Madam Chair.

1283
01:07:33,960 --> 01:07:35,440
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: And good afternoon everyone.

1284
01:07:36,420 --> 01:07:46,700
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: To continue, over 704 local poverty reduction action committees formed out of the almost 1,600.

1285
01:07:46,700 --> 01:07:47,700
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Ito po ay...

1286
01:07:48,280 --> 01:07:54,600
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: 50% po nito ay government sector, meaning in the local government units all over the country.

1287
01:07:55,040 --> 01:07:58,280
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: After having capacitated because of the help also of the Philippine Senate,

1288
01:07:58,440 --> 01:08:02,640
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: actually pinahabol yung 140 million and thank you very much for that.

1289
01:08:03,560 --> 01:08:06,160
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Pero kulang po talaga, ito lang po yung inabot.

1290
01:08:06,720 --> 01:08:10,000
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: In fact, most of the local government institutions through the help of the ULAP,

1291
01:08:10,420 --> 01:08:12,240
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: or Union of Local Authorities of the Philippines,

1292
01:08:12,240 --> 01:08:17,920
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: plus the League of Provinces of the Philippines under the NAPC vice chairperson for government sector,

1293
01:08:18,060 --> 01:08:18,240
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: government institutions.

1294
01:08:18,280 --> 01:08:23,200
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Or Junta Mayo, tumulong na po sila sa gastusin doon po sa grounds.

1295
01:08:23,520 --> 01:08:26,620
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: In other words, for example, sinampulan ng South Catapato,

1296
01:08:26,700 --> 01:08:31,660
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: ang gastos po doon sa provincial poverty reduction action plans sa isang probinsya is more or less 10 million.

1297
01:08:32,220 --> 01:08:33,420
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Sila na po ang gumastos doon.

1298
01:08:34,380 --> 01:08:37,520
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: And sa Mwanga del Sur, even sa Mwanga City,

1299
01:08:37,740 --> 01:08:43,460
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: because we are targeting actually not only that 82 provinces in the country with their consolidated plans.

1300
01:08:43,460 --> 01:08:47,460
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Bottom up, data-driven, and participatory,

1301
01:08:47,460 --> 01:08:54,420
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: because in the 704 local poverty reduction action committees,

1302
01:08:54,860 --> 01:08:59,520
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: may issuance po dito ang local chief executives from the municipalities, cities, and provinces.

1303
01:09:00,320 --> 01:09:02,680
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Tapos po, 50% po niyan ay tinitiyak ng NAPC.

1304
01:09:03,100 --> 01:09:06,200
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Na yung 14 basic sectors po ay walang may iiwanan doon.

1305
01:09:06,860 --> 01:09:11,860
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Yung sektor ng kababaihan, kabataan, including, of course, the PWTs,

1306
01:09:12,280 --> 01:09:15,360
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: and all other sectors, the fisher folk, yung pinakamahirap po ngayon,

1307
01:09:15,360 --> 01:09:17,440
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: and the victims of disasters and calamity.

1308
01:09:17,460 --> 01:09:23,860
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Diyan po ay, in other words, yung hindi na about na 11% na gaps na yan po,

1309
01:09:24,060 --> 01:09:26,360
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: ayan po yung hinahabol at hinahanap ni NAPC.

1310
01:09:26,780 --> 01:09:33,460
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: In fact, in the last NB meeting, it was NAPC who really pushed for the full implementation also

1311
01:09:33,460 --> 01:09:38,660
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: with the help of the Secretary Katsalian and other partners,

1312
01:09:38,900 --> 01:09:41,880
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: partner member agencies of the National Anti-Poverty Commission,

1313
01:09:42,480 --> 01:09:45,960
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: yung ating pong batas na community-based monitoring system.

1314
01:09:45,960 --> 01:09:47,300
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: At tumulong na rin po.

1315
01:09:47,460 --> 01:09:49,580
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: The Armed Forces of the Philippines and Philippine National Police

1316
01:09:49,580 --> 01:09:55,640
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: para abutin po yung mga areas na, especially in the geographically isolated and disadvantaged areas.

1317
01:09:55,740 --> 01:10:02,780
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: In other words, ngayon po ay 704 LGUs na po ito ang nagagawa.

1318
01:10:03,200 --> 01:10:06,920
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Consolidation na lang po because, for example, in the province of Zamboanga del Norte,

1319
01:10:07,040 --> 01:10:09,440
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: the poorest province in the entire country up to this time,

1320
01:10:11,740 --> 01:10:16,580
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: ang ano po natin is 27 LGUs plus the province 28 po.

1321
01:10:17,460 --> 01:10:19,460
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: In three legislative districts.

1322
01:10:20,040 --> 01:10:24,300
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Ito po ay ang gagastusin po sana ng National Anti-Poverty Commission dito

1323
01:10:24,300 --> 01:10:26,320
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: ay mga more or less 16 million

1324
01:10:26,320 --> 01:10:31,740
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: para po doon sa thorough planning process in accordance with Republic Act 11291.

1325
01:10:32,200 --> 01:10:36,520
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Pero kahit na mahirap siya sa Zamboanga del Norte dahil kinakailangan talaga nila ang P-Prop nila,

1326
01:10:37,020 --> 01:10:38,080
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: sila na po ang gumastos.

1327
01:10:39,040 --> 01:10:44,540
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Kaya dahil nakita nila ang pakinabang na yung mga hindi naabot ay naabot talaga

1328
01:10:44,540 --> 01:10:47,380
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: dahil po sa participation ng basic sectors na 14,

1329
01:10:47,460 --> 01:10:52,220
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: plus the 50% of that ay galing po sa government sector.

1330
01:10:52,540 --> 01:10:56,620
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: At dito po ay meron tayong joint, gawargyadong Joint Memorandum Circular.

1331
01:10:56,760 --> 01:11:03,500
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: After the Joint Memorandum Circular 01, Series of 2023 with DBM, with DSWD, with DEB-DEB,

1332
01:11:04,040 --> 01:11:11,060
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: with PSA because dahil ano siya, data-driven, and with DILG,

1333
01:11:11,060 --> 01:11:16,920
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: nagpalabas pa po ng Joint Memorandum Circular, NAPSI, and DILG.

1334
01:11:17,460 --> 01:11:26,780
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: 01, Series of 2025 na sinisiguro na lahat po ng local government units sa buong bansa

1335
01:11:26,780 --> 01:11:33,460
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: ay susunod doon sa template at masiguro po talaga na walang may iwan.

1336
01:11:33,540 --> 01:11:35,740
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Meaning yung mga gaps po ay naka-cover ni NAPSI.

1337
01:11:35,840 --> 01:11:41,300
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Wala pong duplication dahil po yung hindi naaabot ay siguraduhin pong aabotin ni NAPSI.

1338
01:11:41,300 --> 01:11:46,640
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: In my case, as the oversight head for the Local Affairs Coordinating and Monitoring Service,

1339
01:11:47,460 --> 01:11:52,960
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: humbly, I was able to, pinuntahan ko po ang 82 provinces sa buong Pilipinas.

1340
01:11:53,780 --> 01:11:59,560
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: In one year, kahit ko walang supporta gamit ang pinakalumang sasakyan ng gobyerno,

1341
01:11:59,620 --> 01:12:04,640
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: 18 years old vehicle, but anyway, that's public service.

1342
01:12:05,740 --> 01:12:09,560
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Sa proposal po natin, part ng significant accomplishments sa NAPSI before,

1343
01:12:09,560 --> 01:12:16,900
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: yan po yung very briefly natin yung proposal, ay 3,654 basic sectors,

1344
01:12:17,460 --> 01:12:22,820
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: representatives, ay capacitated po and trained in NAPSI on matters pertaining to the full implementation

1345
01:12:22,820 --> 01:12:25,200
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: of the Local Poverty Reduction Action Plan.

1346
01:12:25,580 --> 01:12:30,620
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Ibig sabihin po, yung five na key planners po ng ating pahamalan,

1347
01:12:31,180 --> 01:12:37,880
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: middle managers hanggang sa municipalities po, ay nagsama-sama together with DILG, with DSWD,

1348
01:12:37,880 --> 01:12:46,920
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: almost perfect attendance po, Secretary Rex, ang DSWD, ang DILG, and the five key officials.

1349
01:12:47,300 --> 01:12:47,440
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Isa po.

1350
01:12:47,460 --> 01:12:56,920
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Ibig sabihin po, ay sigurado po tayo, ang larga doon sa grounds ay participatory talaga, data-driven,

1351
01:12:56,920 --> 01:13:11,400
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: and yung budget po, isa rin po, before dito sa, is the strengthened operations and physical target accomplishments po,

1352
01:13:11,740 --> 01:13:17,060
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: at saka strong foundation for the NBANC. Magkakaroon po ng NBANC ang NAPSI ngayong schedule po,

1353
01:13:17,060 --> 01:13:20,140
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: ngayong November, at ginawa na po ang ating preparation.

1354
01:13:21,180 --> 01:13:26,120
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Now, on the budget, ito po ang hinihiling po ng, very briefly,

1355
01:13:26,180 --> 01:13:33,520
Senator Risa Hontiveros: May kopya ako nitong budget proposal sa marinyo, pakifurnish din yung lahat ng mga senador.

1356
01:13:33,520 --> 01:13:38,020
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Ganon din po yung para sa PCUP, itong ganito po.

1357
01:13:38,020 --> 01:13:39,660
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: We will do that. Thank you very much.

1358
01:13:40,220 --> 01:13:43,380
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: And I'll proceed to the agency's request to Congress.

1359
01:13:44,380 --> 01:13:46,980
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Fulfillment of the 4.5 billion,

1360
01:13:47,060 --> 01:13:50,020
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: People's Development Trust Fund under Republic Act 8.425.

1361
01:13:50,020 --> 01:13:59,980
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Nabanggit din po ito ni Sen. Riza and Sen. Marcos po sa 2024 at saka 2025.

1362
01:13:59,980 --> 01:14:01,980
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Ito yung fulfillment po nito.

1363
01:14:01,980 --> 01:14:07,740
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: For the basic sector participation in the LPROP or Local Poverty Reduction Action Plan formulation and implementation,

1364
01:14:07,740 --> 01:14:13,980
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: including the POP, prototyping, capacity building, technical assistance in project development and costing,

1365
01:14:13,980 --> 01:14:16,980
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: sectoral consultations,

1366
01:14:17,060 --> 01:14:22,740
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: convergence workshop, participatory monitoring and documentation of replicable poverty reduction initiatives.

1367
01:14:22,740 --> 01:14:33,460
NAPC Undersecretary Esnaen Catong: Second is on the 1 billion appropriation for the masagalang pamumuhay sa bagong Pilipinas PLAGSI program and special provision.

1368
01:14:33,460 --> 01:14:40,180
