DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: to perform the function. And then,

2398
01:44:47,920 --> 01:44:49,260
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: sinayit doon sa EO na yun, yung

2399
01:44:49,260 --> 01:44:51,660
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: optimization law, na ibalik

2400
01:44:51,660 --> 01:44:53,520
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: na lang yan sa DSWD dahil nga

2401
01:44:53,520 --> 01:44:55,980
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: that function can't be done by DSWD

2402
01:44:55,980 --> 01:44:57,680
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: and NCSC can be

2403
01:44:57,820 --> 01:44:59,620
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: a policy-making body.

2404
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:01,540
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Para hindi na magdagdag ng tao.

2405
01:45:01,740 --> 01:45:04,040
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi yung mga tao namin, dati yun na rin yung ginagawa nila.

2406
01:45:04,140 --> 01:45:05,080
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Wala nang dadagdag pa.

2407
01:45:05,500 --> 01:45:08,420
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero pinawasan natin ng narabaho yung tao namin.

2408
01:45:08,580 --> 01:45:10,320
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Okay naman sa amin. Masaya yung mga tao namin.

2409
01:45:10,500 --> 01:45:12,240
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero ngayon, humingi sila ng dagdag tao.

2410
01:45:12,920 --> 01:45:15,620
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Alright. Last two points na lang, Secretary.

2411
01:45:16,960 --> 01:45:21,480
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Yung sustainable livelihood at saka AICS.

2412
01:45:21,480 --> 01:45:25,440
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Senator Erwin, bago nyo iwan ang NCSC, just one quick question.

2413
01:45:25,580 --> 01:45:27,380
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Salamat. Kay ED, Anna Marie.

2414
01:45:27,380 --> 01:45:33,740
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Ma'am, wala po ba yung chair o kahit sinong commissioner ng NCSC na kasama natin ngayong hapon?

2415
01:45:35,520 --> 01:45:42,320
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Madam Chair, hindi po makakadalo ang ating chair at nag-submit po siya kahapon ng letter.

2416
01:45:43,520 --> 01:45:54,580
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Nag-aasikaso po sila para sa International Intergovernmental Working Group sa Human Rights of Older Persons sa Geneva, Switzerland.

2417
01:45:55,420 --> 01:45:56,580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Oti po yung mga commissioners.

2418
01:45:56,580 --> 01:45:59,360
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Oti po yung mga commissioners. Lahat nag-aasikaso dun sa paghahandang iyon.

2419
01:46:00,340 --> 01:46:01,360
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Hindi naman po.

2420
01:46:03,160 --> 01:46:08,360
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So, sana yung mga commissioners na nandirito ay dumalo rin ngayong hapon sa ating hearing.

2421
01:46:10,480 --> 01:46:13,680
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Pakipaabot po yung feedback po ng chair.

2422
01:46:13,680 --> 01:46:20,580
Senator Risa Hontiveros: And aasahan po namin pati si chair at yung mga commissioners ay kasama din po natin sa budget plenary.

2423
01:46:21,060 --> 01:46:23,700
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Yun po ang custom dito po sa mga budget hearings.

2424
01:46:24,720 --> 01:46:25,820
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Okay po, Madam Chair.

2425
01:46:25,960 --> 01:46:26,440
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Salamat.

2426
01:46:26,580 --> 01:46:26,900
NCSC Acting Executive Director Ana Marie C. Calapit: Okay po.

2427
01:46:27,060 --> 01:46:27,780
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Salamat, ED.

2428
01:46:27,980 --> 01:46:28,320
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Anna Marie.

2429
01:46:28,760 --> 01:46:29,880
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Please proceed, Senator Erwin.

2430
01:46:29,960 --> 01:46:30,220
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Salamat.

2431
01:46:30,240 --> 01:46:32,220
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Kaya wala na sila dito, Madam Chair.

2432
01:46:32,540 --> 01:46:34,260
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pinaubayan nila sa DSWD.

2433
01:46:34,880 --> 01:46:36,400
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Nandiyan naman na DSWD.

2434
01:46:36,820 --> 01:46:40,160
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: If you will not show up your leaders, yung chairman po ninyo at commissioner,

2435
01:46:40,320 --> 01:46:44,180
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: parang sinasabi nyo na ho, sige na, Secretary Rex na lang po magsasalita.

2436
01:46:44,540 --> 01:46:45,700
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pero tama po yun, ma'am.

2437
01:46:45,780 --> 01:46:46,940
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Barang nakaka-insulto.

2438
01:46:47,240 --> 01:46:51,100
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Sabihin nyo na lang ho sa inyong chairman at saka inyong mga commissioners.

2439
01:46:51,160 --> 01:46:51,420
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Ano po?

2440
01:46:52,220 --> 01:46:52,580
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Thank you.

2441
01:46:52,600 --> 01:46:54,040
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Salamat, Senator Erwin.

2442
01:46:54,040 --> 01:46:55,640
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Actually, tingin ko.

2443
01:46:55,640 --> 01:46:59,860
Senator Risa Hontiveros: So, kaya naman nung dalawang ahensya, department at saka commission,

2444
01:47:00,380 --> 01:47:01,160
Senator Risa Hontiveros: i-resolve ito.

2445
01:47:01,200 --> 01:47:04,400
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Alang-alang sa kabutihan ng mga senior citizens natin.

2446
01:47:04,480 --> 01:47:08,220
Senator Risa Hontiveros: At yung autonomy din nung agency na itinayo para sa kanila.

2447
01:47:08,360 --> 01:47:08,680
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Salamat.

2448
01:47:08,760 --> 01:47:09,700
Senator Risa Hontiveros: Please proceed, Senator Erwin.

2449
01:47:09,780 --> 01:47:09,980
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Yes.

2450
01:47:10,220 --> 01:47:11,460
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Last two questions.

2451
01:47:12,320 --> 01:47:15,100
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Let's go to sustainable livelihood program.

2452
01:47:15,480 --> 01:47:19,640
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Binawasan po ba itong SLP ninyo, Secrex?

2453
01:47:20,060 --> 01:47:21,020
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Madam Chair.

2454
01:47:21,820 --> 01:47:24,520
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Madam Chair, it was restored to the NEP level.

2455
01:47:24,520 --> 01:47:25,520
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi yung...

2456
01:47:25,640 --> 01:47:28,500
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nagdagdagan po, nanggaling ho yun during the amendment period.

2457
01:47:29,300 --> 01:47:30,480
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: How much is this po?

2458
01:47:30,860 --> 01:47:31,960
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ayun, tanggal 1 billion.

2459
01:47:32,700 --> 01:47:33,680
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: 1 billion, no?

2460
01:47:33,780 --> 01:47:34,820
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And 1B, no?

2461
01:47:35,420 --> 01:47:35,940
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Ang...

2462
01:47:35,940 --> 01:47:40,980
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: From the original na 6B, naging 5B na lang ho siya.

2463
01:47:41,440 --> 01:47:45,860
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So, that's why we also put it in our tier 2 na sana dagdagan ho beyond even that level.

2464
01:47:46,420 --> 01:47:53,140
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Kasi when I was a secretary, problema na ho talaga ito sa dami po ng kailangan sa mga regional offices po na ninyo.

2465
01:47:54,320 --> 01:47:55,140
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pati po yung...

2466
01:47:55,640 --> 01:47:57,880
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Mga LGUs na...

2467
01:47:57,880 --> 01:48:01,480
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Siyempre, gusto po nila na mabigyan na kabuhayan yung constituents nila.

2468
01:48:01,660 --> 01:48:02,700
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Nakikita po nila yun.

2469
01:48:03,160 --> 01:48:04,340
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pero with limited budget.

2470
01:48:04,480 --> 01:48:09,520
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: So, you're saying that you're requesting na probably another 1B para sa sustainable livelihood?

2471
01:48:09,900 --> 01:48:17,660
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Actually, Madam Chair, during our tier 2, pinaabot ho namin yung request namin na karagdagang 3.5B para kukam na close to 10 billion.

2472
01:48:17,840 --> 01:48:18,460
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Tama ho kayo.

2473
01:48:19,440 --> 01:48:22,260
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Madam Chair, the good senator knows this very well.

2474
01:48:22,800 --> 01:48:25,520
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Itong programa na ito, nakakatulong ito in the long run.

2475
01:48:25,640 --> 01:48:29,860
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi halimbawa yung umaalis sa 4Bs, doon natin pinapasok para hindi nababalik sa kahirapan.

2476
01:48:30,020 --> 01:48:31,600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And it's teaching them how to fish.

2477
01:48:32,480 --> 01:48:34,080
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Tama po yun, Madam Chair.

2478
01:48:34,240 --> 01:48:39,420
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Because parang grant po ito kasi, Madam Chair, itong SLP.

2479
01:48:39,740 --> 01:48:42,520
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Hindi kagayang sa DTI, binabayaran sila.

2480
01:48:42,620 --> 01:48:46,700
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pero ito talagang ibibigay po ng DSWD para pangkabuhayan.

2481
01:48:46,700 --> 01:48:49,080
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Well, anyway, moving to another topic.

2482
01:48:49,240 --> 01:48:53,140
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Ito, medyo sensitive po ito at saka napapanahon.

2483
01:48:53,560 --> 01:48:55,480
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Last year po, kami po...

2484
01:48:55,480 --> 01:49:04,980
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Ni SP, tinaasan po namin when he was the Finance Chair, yung inyo pong Assistance for Individuals in Crisis.

2485
01:49:05,980 --> 01:49:07,240
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Wala pa pong gera noon.

2486
01:49:07,740 --> 01:49:11,880
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Wala pa pong mga sakuna, kung ano man po yan, dilubyo.

2487
01:49:12,340 --> 01:49:18,300
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pero we anticipated na baka may mangyari kasi medyo nagkakagirian na po yung Amerika at Iran.

2488
01:49:19,080 --> 01:49:21,600
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Tama nga po yung naging desisyon na dagdagan po kayo.

2489
01:49:21,600 --> 01:49:23,880
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Umabot po tayo ng 63 something billion.

2490
01:49:24,400 --> 01:49:25,140
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Di tama nga.

2491
01:49:25,140 --> 01:49:29,140
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Ang presidente, kayong unang inilagay sa front line to address the problems.

2492
01:49:29,940 --> 01:49:38,740
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pwede po ba ng mga ating mga transport, pambilin ng mga gasolina, yung mga OFWs natin, tumulong din po kayo.

2493
01:49:38,840 --> 01:49:41,940
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: So talagang malaki po na gastos po ninyo doon.

2494
01:49:42,460 --> 01:49:46,700
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pero nagtataka lang po ako, binawasan po sa NEP ninyo.

2495
01:49:47,120 --> 01:49:50,980
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pero dinagdagan naman na umabot na po sa 30 something billion.

2496
01:49:50,980 --> 01:49:52,600
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Well, that is sufficient enough.

2497
01:49:53,260 --> 01:49:55,100
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: We're anticipating right now.

2498
01:49:55,140 --> 01:49:56,860
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Paparating po itong El Nino.

2499
01:49:57,660 --> 01:50:00,300
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Tapos ito pong gyera sa Iran, di pa po tapos.

2500
01:50:00,440 --> 01:50:02,540
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Hindi natin alam kung hanggang kailan po ito.

2501
01:50:03,220 --> 01:50:05,200
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Baka ikang umabot na rito.

2502
01:50:05,360 --> 01:50:10,960
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pati nga po yung Yemen, Somalia, Saudi Arabia, mga Houthis.

2503
01:50:11,860 --> 01:50:14,920
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Kung saan saan na ho nag-ikang umugat itong problema nito.

2504
01:50:15,320 --> 01:50:16,420
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Meron tayong yun.

2505
01:50:16,540 --> 01:50:23,400
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Yung El Nino, tapos hindi pa po natin alam kung ano talagang epekto nito.

2506
01:50:23,400 --> 01:50:25,320
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: So, papano ito?

2507
01:50:25,480 --> 01:50:26,360
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: What are you planning?

2508
01:50:26,740 --> 01:50:27,720
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Is it enough?

2509
01:50:27,800 --> 01:50:29,620
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Is it enough na dinagdagan po sa gab?

2510
01:50:30,360 --> 01:50:32,700
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Unfortunately, una po, Madam Chair,

2511
01:50:32,800 --> 01:50:34,960
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: gusto kong magpasalamat kay Senator Erwin,

2512
01:50:35,120 --> 01:50:38,020
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: kay Senator Sherwin dahil binalik ko yan na dinagdagan.

2513
01:50:38,680 --> 01:50:40,820
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yung dinagdag ho naging standby fund natin.

2514
01:50:40,920 --> 01:50:43,580
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nung kasagsagan nito, at hindi ko naman pwede sabihin natapos na,

2515
01:50:43,680 --> 01:50:45,020
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: nung sa transport sector alone,

2516
01:50:45,720 --> 01:50:51,660
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: close to 10 billion in one month ang ginamit natin para sa mga transport workers natin.

2517
01:50:51,660 --> 01:50:53,060
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Doon natin kinuha yun.

2518
01:50:53,060 --> 01:50:54,340
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: It became our lifeline.

2519
01:50:55,060 --> 01:50:56,680
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So, kaya naka-respond tayo kaagad.

2520
01:50:56,760 --> 01:51:00,580
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: In fact, nagpa-quick survey ho ang SWS tulad na nabanggit ko kanina.

2521
01:51:01,040 --> 01:51:04,260
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: 96% of the respondents doon sa catchment said,

2522
01:51:04,660 --> 01:51:07,420
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: ginamit nila yung pera para magpatuloy ng hanap buhay.

2523
01:51:07,920 --> 01:51:12,720
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: 80% naman ang sinabi, ginamit nila yun para makabili ng pagkain nung nangangailangan sila.

2524
01:51:13,100 --> 01:51:17,740
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So, ngayon nangangamba ho kami sa pagbawas na meron nga triple whammy na ina-anticipate,

2525
01:51:18,120 --> 01:51:19,180
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: pero nabawasan naman ho kami.

2526
01:51:19,360 --> 01:51:22,720
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kaya nga ho, maraming salamat sa tanong na dumudulog kami ngayon ulit

2527
01:51:22,720 --> 01:51:30,400
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: sa Komitee at sa Senado na sana ibalik man lang doon sa level ng GAAP last year.

2528
01:51:30,840 --> 01:51:32,660
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kahit ngayon, very tight na eh.

2529
01:51:33,000 --> 01:51:36,020
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero kung talagang tight fiscal space, maibalik man lang doon.

2530
01:51:36,380 --> 01:51:38,600
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Palagay ko, mas kakayanin natin ng konti po.

2531
01:51:39,360 --> 01:51:41,900
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Will that sustain isa ka sakali?

2532
01:51:42,080 --> 01:51:46,040
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: I mean, ang pinag-usapan lang kasi natin, in-anticipate natin po yung El Niño.

2533
01:51:46,680 --> 01:51:51,160
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Pero paano kung may mga darating pa ng mga dilubyok at baka magkakaroon pa po ng gera,

2534
01:51:51,160 --> 01:51:52,180
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: hindi ho natin alam.

2535
01:51:52,720 --> 01:51:59,260
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Will that be sufficient na ikanga para, kasi kayo po laging pag may mga ganito sitwasyon,

2536
01:51:59,660 --> 01:52:02,040
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: DSWD, nandoon ho kayo sa front line.

2537
01:52:02,500 --> 01:52:06,500
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: May problema po ang mga magsasakan natin, DSWD, natulong din po.

2538
01:52:06,660 --> 01:52:08,700
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Mangingis na, DSWD pa rin ho.

2539
01:52:08,840 --> 01:52:13,640
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: So, ano ho, what is your take on this?

2540
01:52:14,500 --> 01:52:17,960
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Sabi ko ho ito sa House, nung pinatawag ho kami during the budget season,

2541
01:52:17,960 --> 01:52:19,420
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: nangangamba rin ho kami.

2542
01:52:20,040 --> 01:52:22,480
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Nangangamba kami na yung natira na,

2543
01:52:22,480 --> 01:52:26,660
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: eh maaaring hindi sasapat, kaya dumudulog ho kami na sana ibalik man lang,

2544
01:52:26,800 --> 01:52:29,260
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: man lang, to the minimum sa gaal level.

2545
01:52:30,160 --> 01:52:33,800
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Madam Chair, tama ho kayo na kulang kung titignan.

2546
01:52:34,360 --> 01:52:37,300
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero gusto ko rin ho i-assure yung committee na kung mabalik ho yun,

2547
01:52:37,440 --> 01:52:41,920
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: kaya naman namin i-balance siya with the quick response.

2548
01:52:42,080 --> 01:52:44,020
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Kasi kanina nabanggit na rin ho yung quick response.

2549
01:52:44,480 --> 01:52:48,780
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Dahil the quick response, kami ho ang pinaka, DSWD po ang pinakamalaking user po noon.

2550
01:52:49,380 --> 01:52:51,320
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: So, pinagsasabay ho namin gamitin yan.

2551
01:52:51,320 --> 01:52:53,460
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero admittedly, kahit tignan nyo yung quick response,

2552
01:52:53,560 --> 01:52:58,200
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: by this time, medyo konti na rin ho yung balance ng Ndream Fund.

2553
01:52:58,740 --> 01:53:00,340
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Meron pa, pero konti na.

2554
01:53:00,860 --> 01:53:04,440
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Now, Madam Chair, there was a year na binibigyan kami ng Office of,

2555
01:53:04,500 --> 01:53:06,460
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: which is, hindi naman dapat,

2556
01:53:06,640 --> 01:53:11,620
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: but binibigyan kami rin ng contingency fund galing sa Office of the President to augment.

2557
01:53:11,920 --> 01:53:15,160
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Pero alam ko po yung sinasabi nyo na paano pag hindi kayo bigyan,

2558
01:53:15,380 --> 01:53:16,880
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: eh di mabibitin ho.

2559
01:53:16,880 --> 01:53:21,100
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And kung pwede ho, dagdagan pa beyond the gaal level because of the anticipated,

2560
01:53:21,320 --> 01:53:23,700
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: inflationary effects na tuloy-tuloy.

2561
01:53:24,180 --> 01:53:30,400
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: Yung El Nino na not just the farmers, but the prices of goods and food actually,

2562
01:53:30,900 --> 01:53:31,700
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: baka tumaas rin.

2563
01:53:32,100 --> 01:53:36,240
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: And then, meron pa ho yung sunod-sunod na mga regular ho na mga pangangailangan,

2564
01:53:36,360 --> 01:53:37,380
DSWD Secretary Rex Gatchalian: talagang kukulangin po.

2565
01:53:38,340 --> 01:53:38,660
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Alright.

2566
01:53:39,400 --> 01:53:42,680
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Yung QRF ho na nabanggit ho ninyo last year,

2567
01:53:43,040 --> 01:53:45,520
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: nung nagkagulo na nga po, nagkagero na nga.

2568
01:53:45,520 --> 01:53:49,580
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: I called my good friend, Yuseca Dayan Cahipe.

2569
01:53:50,120 --> 01:53:51,240
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Sabi niya, meron pa naman.

2570
01:53:51,320 --> 01:53:52,840
Senator Erwin T. Tulfo: Sen, may budget pa.

2571
01:53:53,240 --> 01:53:56,760
